1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,908
Oil tanker traffic through the Strait of Hormuz has nearly stopped after renewed US strikes on Iran and attacks on commercial vessels, gCaptain reports from Reuters.

2
00:00:11,858 --> 00:00:18,285
The disruption matters because the strait normally carries a large share of global oil.

3
00:00:18,285 --> 00:00:26,035
Higher war-risk insurance and delayed voyages could raise costs for energy buyers and shipping companies.

